@startuml PostureCare_Deployment
!theme plain
title PostureCare Deployment Architecture v2.0 - Phase 2 with GraphQL API

package "Host Machine" {
  package "Docker Engine + WSL 2" {
    package "posture-net (Bridge Network)" {

      component "PostgreSQL 15" as postgres
      note right of postgres
        PostgreSQL Container
        Port: 5432
        Database: posture_db
        Volume: postgres_data
        Data: Patient metadata, sessions
      end note

      component "Redis 7" as redis
      note right of redis
        Redis Container
        Port: 6379
        Service: Pub/Sub + Cache
        Volume: redis_data
      end note

      component "Prometheus" as prometheus
      note right of prometheus
        Prometheus Container
        Port: 9090
        Service: Time-Series DB
        Volume: prometheus_data
        Retention: 15 days
      end note

      component "Push Gateway" as pushgw
      note right of pushgw
        Push Gateway Container
        Port: 9091
        Service: Batch Metrics Receiver
      end note

      component "GraphQL API" as graphql_api
      note right of graphql_api
        FastAPI + Strawberry
        Port: 8000
        Service: Data Query Layer
        Auth: API Key (X-API-Key)
      end note

      component "Grafana" as grafana
      note right of grafana
        Grafana Container
        Port: 3000
        Service: Dashboard Platform
        Volume: grafana_data
      end note

      prometheus --> pushgw : scrape (every 15s)
      grafana --> prometheus : PromQL queries
      grafana --> postgres : metadata queries
      grafana --> graphql_api : REST/GraphQL
      graphql_api --> postgres : patient queries
      graphql_api --> prometheus : sensor metrics
      graphql_api --> redis : pub/sub, cache
      pushgw --> prometheus : batch metrics
    }
  }

  package "Host Filesystem" {
    database ProjectRoot
    note right of ProjectRoot
      docker-compose.yml
      .env
      prometheus/
      grafana/
      services/graphql_api/
      scripts/
      sample-data/
    end note
  }

  package "Browser/Client Access" {
    rectangle GrafanaUI
    note right of GrafanaUI
      http://localhost:3000
      Dashboards: Clinician, Researcher, DevOps
    end note
    rectangle PrometheusUI
    note right of PrometheusUI
      http://localhost:9090
      Query Builder
    end note
    rectangle GraphQLPlayground
    note right of GraphQLPlayground
      http://localhost:8000/graphql
      Interactive API Explorer
    end note
    rectangle APIClient
    note right of APIClient
      External BI Tools
      Mobile Apps
    end note
  }
}

GrafanaUI -.-> grafana : HTTP (admin/admin)
PrometheusUI -.-> prometheus : HTTP
GraphQLPlayground -.-> graphql_api : HTTP + API Key
APIClient -.-> graphql_api : GraphQL/REST + Auth

@enduml